{"id":"8469ff36e1bb7dd6","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-ph-collapse.md","title":"Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse","display":"thm-ph-collapse — Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-ph-collapse","aliases":["28-thm-ph-collapse","Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse Theorem"],"display":"thm-ph-collapse — Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse","depends_on":["[[28-df-ph]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-ph-collapse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-ph-collapse</span><span>Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse Theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ph-collapse — Polynomial Hierarchy Collapse"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3490cd4d54ac2474\" href=\"?note=3490cd4d54ac2474\" title=\"28-df-ph\">28-df-ph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PH}\">\\(\\mathbf{PH}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 见本目录定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式：在更高层描述中，把最内侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 块尾部视为一个属于第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 层的语言，以相反首量词但仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 块的描述替换；相邻同类量词合并，反复消去高于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的块。输入与外部已量化变量拼成新输入，长度仍为多项式。第二式按层归纳：若上一层及其补类均可确定多项式时间判断，下一层的首存在块成为 NP 验证，于假设下也在 P。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理5.4；印刷97–98页；PDF123–124页。第二式原书证明已读，第一式原书留作习题5.12，此处给出本地消块证明梗概。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-ph","status":"resolved","id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sigma-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-pi-k-p","status":"resolved","id":"2bc4265180c3d2ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-pi-k-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}=\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathbf{NP}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\mathbf{PH}=\\mathbf P.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1416,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层级关系：[[28-thm-atm-characterizes-ph]]、[[28-thm-ph-contained-pspace]]、[[28-thm-ph-collapse]]、[[28-thm-karp-lipton]]。"},{"id":"b9f22036ffa6885b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3490cd4d54ac2474","e4f9f10bc85fd486","2bc4265180c3d2ff","dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8"]}